{"id":"cuanto","lemma":"cuanto","pos":"det","rank":388,"glosses":["as much [of]; as many; however much; however many","few; quite a few; a handful","however much; however many; (constructing parallel comparatives) “the..., the...”"],"ipa":"/ˈkwanto/","forms":{"plural":"cuantos","feminine":"cuanta","femininePlural":"cuantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-cuanto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gustaría empezar cuanto antes.","en":"I'd like to get started.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611848","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to start"},null,{"g":"earlier"}]},{"text":"Tenemos unos cuantos.","en":"We have some.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450871","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"about, approximately"},null]},{"text":"Creo que eso es cuanto me hace falta.","en":"I believe that's all I need.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/604978","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},null,null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"lack, shortage"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Sé unas cuantas cosas.","en":"I know a few things.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/138010","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"an","l":"un"},null,{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"}]},{"text":"Aquí tienes, prueba unos cuantos.","en":"Here, try some.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/850205","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"proof"},{"g":"about, approximately"},null]}]}